A["Sibling: checked request"] --> B["Owner allows sending the issue"]
B --> C["Planveyor: request imported as PI"]
C --> D["Planveyor's Architect decides if a plan is needed"]
D --> E["ACK: decision link (and execution link, if any)"]
E -->|"change accepted"| F["New version (with a notice if the contract changes)"]
F --> G["Sibling: upgrade and fix check"]
